{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026NlSyesT11Y1793199751.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>食環署表示過去兩個月，在紅磡一個私人屋苑一帶共捕獲77隻老鼠，署方會繼續依法跟進，呼籲私人屋苑及商場等各場地管理者履行管理責任，做好源頭治理。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.RAT-2130.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026BWBfLcKV831793199767.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>針對紅磡必嘉坊一帶的鼠患，食環署指已在周日，調派夜間防治鼠患流動隊，放置捕鼠器及增設鼠餌點，加強清洗附近街道及後巷，並加密清理垃圾桶。又向附近食肆等發出《消除蟲鼠通知》，要求他們在指定期限內採取改善措施等。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.RAT-2130_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026Jjm5MCpUcj1793199785.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>至於港鐵站及公園等場所，署方指已向相關機構及主管部門提供專業技術意見，並在周邊公眾地方加強防鼠。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T15:58:15.378999+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":224,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T13:47:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T23:38:08.392995+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T15:55:39.576744+00:00","content_hash":"ed3fda2f86e7ece0fd86baeb9b56469c20c13693ba296b309753e0ceea15487f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-28T15:58:15.378999+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}